{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic <strong>point-and-click</strong> adventures, Two Realms blends <strong>fast-paced horror and drama</strong> with modern mechanics and a deep, atmospheric story. Step into Tobias\u2019s shoes and help him save his brother in a dark fantasy medieval world brought to life with <strong>crunchy pixel art</strong>, a <strong>goosebump-inducing soundtrack</strong> and <strong>full voice acting</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/e53091c1416c8075df2ff161af7071f4.poster.avif?t=1773392784\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/e53091c1416c8075df2ff161af7071f4.webm?t=1773392784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/e53091c1416c8075df2ff161af7071f4.mp4?t=1773392784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tobias and his younger brother Juno live a quiet life \u2014 until a mysterious crystal and a foreboding mage shatter it forever. After their encounter, Juno falls gravely ill, as if his very life force has been drained away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forced onto a quest he never chose, Tobias sets out in desperation to save his brother.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom's capital offers a glimpse of hope - Tobias's sister, a gifted healer living there, could help, and the Citadel's library may hold a sliver of vital knowledge. But as the terrifying mage closes in and unsettling whispers echo in Tobias\u2019s mind, it becomes clear that time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Descend into the darkness,</i> <br><i>fight the evil inside</i> <br><i>and seek the wits to help those</i> <br><i>who once stood by your side.</i><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/be092e76616235edf7516bea827e1d00.poster.avif?t=1773392784\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/be092e76616235edf7516bea827e1d00.webm?t=1773392784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/be092e76616235edf7516bea827e1d00.mp4?t=1773392784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern point-and-click gameplay</strong> with a streamlined interface, snappy pacing, and intuitive puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6-8 hours of <strong>story-driven adventure</strong> set in a dark <strong>medieval fantasy world</strong>, with unexpected twists and harrowing moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-animated pixel art</strong>, an original <strong>atmospheric soundtrack</strong>, and <strong>full voice acting</strong> performed by British actors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A memorable cast of characters</strong>, including caring healer Adelina, scruffy mystic Severin, and ominous mage Thaddeus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/88fe14a691ad97f461bbfadeb910469f.poster.avif?t=1773392784\" width=1170 height=349 ><source src=\"https: