item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/be092e76616235edf7516bea827e1d00.mp4?t=1773392784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern point-and-click gameplay</strong> with a streamlined interface, snappy pacing, and intuitive puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6-8 hours of <strong>story-driven adventure</strong> set in a dark <strong>medieval fantasy world</strong>, with unexpected twists and harrowing moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-animated pixel art</strong>, an original <strong>atmospheric soundtrack</strong>, and <strong>full voice acting</strong> performed by British actors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A memorable cast of characters</strong>, including caring healer Adelina, scruffy mystic Severin, and ominous mage Thaddeus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/88fe14a691ad97f461bbfadeb910469f.poster.avif?t=1773392784\" width=1170 height=349 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/extras/88fe14a691ad97f461bbfadeb910469f.webm?t=1773392784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["MOD42 Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620350/42726f75de034f51b7957be674ac4d3612f09831/header.jpg?t=1773392784","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memor